{
  "bodyHash": "qsFbmCYOEas=",
  "content": "你好世界<p><center><a title=\"https://cobblemon.com\" href=\"https://cobblemon.com\"><img src=\"https://gitlab.com/cable-mc/cobblemon-assets/-/raw/master/graphics/aerodactyl_banner.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"660\" height=\"660\" /></a></center></p>\n<p><center><span><strong><font size=\"5\">Cobblemon模组的官方整合包</font></strong><em>（适用于Fabric）</em></span></center></p>\n<p><center><span><em><img src=\"https://gitlab.com/cable-mc/cobblemon-assets/-/raw/master/graphics/cobblemon_divider.png?ref_type=heads\" /></em></span></center></p>\n<center><iframe width=\"560\" height=\"315\" src=\"https://www.youtube.com/embed/2tsCcWbiYgA?si=zAfUCC1MLsPih05i\" title=\"YouTube video player\" frameborder=\"0\" allow=\"accelerometer; autoplay; clipboard-write; encrypted-media; gyroscope; picture-in-picture; web-share\" allowfullscreen></iframe></center>\n<p><center><span><img src=\"https://gitlab.com/cable-mc/cobblemon-assets/-/raw/master/graphics/cobblemon_divider.png?ref_type=heads\" alt=\"\" width=\"838\" height=\"32\" /></span></center></p>\n<p><center><span><font size=\"4\"><strong><em>Cobblemon特性（目前已有）：</em></strong></font></span></center></p>\n<ul>\n<li><span>捕捉宝可梦来扩充你的队伍，与野生宝可梦战斗获取经验，升级以学习新招式，并让你的宝可梦进化。可捕捉的宝可梦超过700种！</span></li>\n<li><span>使用<a title=\"https://pokemonshowdown.com\" href=\"https://pokemonshowdown.com\"><span><em>Pokémon Showdown!</em></span></a>引擎进行对战，确保精准的竞技对战机制。</span></li>\n<li><span>部分《传说 阿尔宙斯》风格机制，例如回忆招式、在战斗中物理逃跑，以及由<em>你</em>决定何时进化宝可梦。</span></li>\n<li><span>在战斗中可切换自由移动。你可以在宝可梦对战时建造、挖矿或与怪物战斗！</span></li>\n<li><span>用图鉴记录你见过和捕捉过的宝可梦，图鉴还带有扫描功能，可分析野生宝可梦！</span></li>\n<li><span>骑乘宝可梦，以炫酷的方式探索Minecraft世界！</span></li>\n<li><span>你可以在多人模式中与朋友交换和对战。</span></li>\n<li><span>使用牧场，让宝可梦在任何你喜欢的地方自由活动！</span></li>\n<li><span>树果可在野外找到，可在耕地上种植，使用覆盖物获得加成，还可通过杂交变异出新的树果。</span></li>\n<li><span>用农作物和树果放入酿造台可制作药品。酿造的药剂回复效果更佳！</span></li>\n<li><span>世界中有古老的遗迹等待发现。部分遗迹内有镀金宝箱，可能包含有价值的战利品或其他惊喜！</span></li>\n<li><span>在特定地点挖掘可疑的沙砾或沙子可找到化石，之后可用复活机器复活它们。</span></li>\n<li><span>第1~9代的全部宝可梦均可生成并对战，不过如果它们尚未拥有模型，则会以替代玩偶的形式显示。</span></li>\n<li><span>完全支持通过数据包和资源包自定义宝可梦变体和原创宝可梦。你可在<a href=\"https://cobblemon.com/guides/custompokemon.html\">我们的指南</a>中找到操作方法！</span></li>\n<li><span><strong><em>……还有更多特性即将推出！</em></strong></span></li>\n</ul>\n<p><center><span><em><img src=\"https://gitlab.com/cable-mc/cobblemon-assets/-/raw/master/graphics/cobblemon_divider.png?ref_type=heads\" /></em></span></center></p>\n<p><center><span><font size=\"5\"><strong>关于本整合包：</strong></font></span></center></p>\n<p><center>Cobblemon整合包旨在通过改进的视觉效果和音频提升你的Minecraft沉浸感，同时通过使用众多优化模组，使其运行效果优于原版Cobblemon。此外还添加了一些生活品质优化功能，以改善游戏体验，但不会对原版Minecraft进行重大改动。包含可选的额外内容，如推荐资源包和光影包，默认情况下为禁用状态。</center></p>\n<p><center><strong><em>注意：</em>Cobblemon没有官方服务器。</strong>你可以在我们的<a title=\"https://cobblemon.com/en/servers\" href=\"https://cobblemon.com/en/servers\">网站</a>或Discord的#server-listings频道中找到公共服务器列表，并将其添加到多人游戏菜单中。或者，你也可以从主机提供商（如<a title=\"https://www.bisecthosting.com/cobblemon\" href=\"https://www.bisecthosting.com/cobblemon\"><strong>BisectHosting</strong></a>）购买自己的服务器。</center></p>\n<p><center><img src=\"https://gitlab.com/cable-mc/cobblemon-assets/-/raw/master/graphics/bisect_banner2.webp\" alt=\"\" width=\"2172\" height=\"360\" /></center></p>\n<p><center><span><font size=\"4\"><strong><em>技术细节：</em></strong></font></span></center></p>\n<ul>\n<li>无论是整合包还是服务器包，均可连接至原版Cobblemon服务器和客户端。</li>\n<li>建议至少分配2.5 GB内存运行。<em>为获得最佳性能，请使用3 GB或更多内存。</em></li>\n<li>本整合包适用于<strong>Fabric</strong>，但NeoForge版本也可在<a title=\"https://modrinth.com/modpack/cobblemon-neoforge\" href=\"https://modrinth.com/modpack/cobblemon-neoforge\">此处</a>获取。<strong>推荐使用Fabric版本，因其性能更佳。</strong></li>\n</ul>\n<p><center><span><em><img src=\"https://gitlab.com/cable-mc/cobblemon-assets/-/raw/master/graphics/cobblemon_divider.png?ref_type=heads\" /></em></span></center></p>\n<p><center><span><font size=\"5\"><strong>欢迎来到Cobbled Farms！</strong></font></span></center></p>\n<p><center><img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/MdwFAVRL/images/6336a540086f194fd67f2a1115472fa8f9e25043.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"445\" height=\"250\" /></center></p>\n<p><center>欢迎来到<a title=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/worlds/cobbled-farms\" href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/worlds/cobbled-farms\">Cobbled Farms</a>，这是一个捆绑的单人世界，向新手和资深训练师介绍Cobblemon的特性！你的任务是帮助这个小型农业社区的居民维护他们美丽的家园。幸运的是，他们临走前留下了书籍，解释了你需要知道的关于维护Cobbled Farms的一切，甚至包括如何在你自己的世界或服务器中创建自己的农业社区！请务必在每个主要更新时回来查看教程世界的新版本，了解Cobblemon开发团队可能添加的任何新特性。祝农耕愉快！</center></p>\n<p><center><img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/MdwFAVRL/images/ee13bf1fefdebae3ce0de6901dc378cbe12035f4.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"889\" height=\"500\" /></center></p>\n<p><center><span><em><img src=\"https://gitlab.com/cable-mc/cobblemon-assets/-/raw/master/graphics/cobblemon_divider.png?ref_type=heads\" /></em></span></center></p>\n<p><center><em><strong>注意：</strong></em>Cobblemon模组仍在开发中，并会积极更新。许多功能仍在制作中或为临时替代品，直至完成。部分现有功能也会随着我们的持续开发而得到进一步打磨。还计划了更多功能，包括但不限于NPC、骑乘宝可梦、培育和建筑等。</center></p>\n<p><center>加入我们的Discord以关注开发进度、与团队交流、提问，并抢先了解即将推出的功能！</center></p>\n<p><center><a title=\"https://discord.gg/cobblemon\" href=\"https://discord.gg/cobblemon\"><img src=\"https://gitlab.com/cable-mc/cobblemon-assets/-/raw/master/graphics/discord_button.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"224\" height=\"50\" /></a><span style=\"font-size: 18px;\"></span></center></p>\n<p><center><span><em><img src=\"https://gitlab.com/cable-mc/cobblemon-assets/-/raw/master/graphics/cobblemon_divider.png?ref_type=heads\" /></em></span></center></p>\n<p><center><span><font size=\"5\"><strong>整合包内容：</strong></font></span></center></p>\n<p><center><em>此整合包允许客户端连接至仅运行Cobblemon和Fabric API的服务器。</em></center></p>\n<p><center><em>如果你希望自行使用其中的任何模组，请从其原始页面下载，以支持其作者。</em></center></p>\n<h4><strong>模组：</strong></h4>\n<li><a href=\"https://modrinth.com/mod/advanced-loot-info\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow noopener noreferrer\">Advanced Loot Info</a> - EMI插件，用于显示战利品表信息。</li>\n<li><a href=\"https://modrinth.com/mod/ambient-environment\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow noopener noreferrer\">Ambient Environment</a> - 为生物群系颜色添加色彩噪声。</li>\n<li><a href=\"https://modrinth.com/mod/appleskin\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow noopener noreferrer\">AppleSkin</a> - 显示更多与食物相关的数值信息。</li>\n<li><a href=\"https://modrinth.com/mod/bad-wither-no-cookie\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow noopener noreferrer\">Bad Wither No Cookie - Reloaded</a> - 将许多响亮的全服广播音效改为本地音效。</li>\n<li><a href=\"https://modrinth.com/mod/better-advancements\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow noopener noreferrer\">Better Advancements</a> - 放大进度页面并显示进度信息。</li>\n<li><a href=\"https://modrinth.com/mod/better-ping-display-fabric\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow noopener noreferrer\">Better Ping Display</a> - 在玩家列表中显示每位玩家的延迟（以毫秒为单位）。</li>\n<li><a href=\"https://modrinth.com/mod/better-third-person\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow noopener noreferrer\">Better Third Person</a> - 允许在第三人称视角下独立旋转相机。<a href=\"https://gyazo.com/c225d60a5d871b3676e2835896a7e0ad\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow noopener noreferrer\"><em>授权</em></a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://modrinth.com/mod/cherished-worlds\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow noopener noreferrer\">Cherished Worlds</a> - 添加书签和搜索世界的功能。</li>\n<li><a href=\"https://modrinth.com/mod/cit-resewn\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow noopener noreferrer\">CIT Resewn</a> - 为资源包添加对MCPatcher的自定义物品纹理（CIT）的支持。</li>\n<li><a href=\"https://modrinth.com/mod/clumps\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow noopener noreferrer\">Clumps</a> - 将彼此靠近的经验球合并为一个实体，以减少延迟。</li>\n<li><a href=\"https://cobblemon.com/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow noopener noreferrer\">Cobblemon</a> - 将宝可梦添加到你的Minecraft中。</li>\n<li><a href=\"https://modrinth.com/mod/crafting-tweaks\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow noopener noreferrer\">Crafting Tweaks</a> - 允许使用按钮旋转、平衡或清空合成格。<a href=\"https://gyazo.com/40a91e89ff83c69c3dce16fe8ca184c8\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow noopener noreferrer\"><em>授权</em></a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://modrinth.com/mod/craftpresence\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow noopener noreferrer\">CraftPresence</a> - 在Discord上显示正在玩的游戏信息。</li>\n<li><a href=\"https://modrinth.com/mod/dynamiccrosshair\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow noopener noreferrer\">Dynamic Crosshair</a> - 根据视线目标改变准星样式。</li>\n<li><a href=\"https://modrinth.com/mod/emi\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow noopener noreferrer\">EMI</a> - 添加物品和配方查看器，与JEI集成。</li>\n<li><a href=\"https://modrinth.com/mod/emi-enchanting\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow noopener noreferrer\">EMI Enchanting</a> - EMI插件，提供基本附魔信息。</li>\n<li><a href=\"https://modrinth.com/mod/emi-ores\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow noopener noreferrer\">EMI Ores</a> - EMI插件，显示矿石在世界中生成的信息。</li>\n<li><a href=\"https://modrinth.com/mod/emi-professions-(emip)\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow noopener noreferrer\">EMI professions (EMIP)</a> - EMI插件，添加职业工作站的相关信息。</li>\n<li><a href=\"https://modrinth.com/mod/enchantment-descriptions\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow noopener noreferrer\">Enchantment Descriptions</a> - 在附魔书的工具提示中添加附魔描述。</li>\n<li><a href=\"https://modrinth.com/mod/enhanced-attack-indicator\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow noopener noreferrer\">Enhanced Attack Indicator</a> - 在更多操作上显示攻击指示器的进度条。</li>\n<li><a href=\"https://modrinth.com/mod/entityculling\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow noopener noreferrer\">Entity Culling</a> - 跳过渲染不可见的实体，以提升性能。</li>\n<li><a href=\"https://modrinth.com/mod/entity-model-features\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow noopener noreferrer\">Entity Model Features (EMF)</a> - 为资源包添加对OptiFine的自定义实体模型（CEM）的支持。</li>\n<li><a href=\"https://modrinth.com/mod/entitytexturefeatures\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow noopener noreferrer\">Entity Texture Features (ETF)</a> - 为资源包添加对OptiFine的实体纹理特性（ETF）的支持。</li>\n<li><a href=\"https://modrinth.com/mod/fallingleaves\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow noopener noreferrer\">Falling Leaves</a> - 添加飘落的树叶和雪花粒子。</li>\n<li><a href=\"https://modrinth.com/mod/fancymenu\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow noopener noreferrer\">FancyMenu</a> - 自定义主菜单。</li>\n<li><a href=\"https://modrinth.com/mod/ferrite-core\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow noopener noreferrer\">FerriteCore</a> - 优化内存使用。</li>\n<li><a href=\"https://modrinth.com/mod/immediatelyfast\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow noopener noreferrer\">ImmediatelyFast</a> - 优化即时渲染。</li>\n<li><a href=\"https://modrinth.com/mod/invmove\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow noopener noreferrer\">InvMove</a> - 添加在背包界面中移动的能力。</li>\n<li><a href=\"https://modrinth.com/mod/invmovecompats\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow noopener noreferrer\">InvMoveCompats</a> - 为InvMove添加与EMI和JEI的兼容性。</li>\n<li><a href=\"https://modrinth.com/mod/just-enough-effect-descriptions-jeed\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow noopener noreferrer\">Just Enough Effect Descriptions (JEED)</a> - JEI插件，显示所有状态效果的信息。</li>\n<li><a href=\"https://modrinth.com/mod/jei\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow noopener noreferrer\">Just Enough Items</a> - 添加物品和配方查看器。</li>\n<li><a href=\"https://modrinth.com/mod/krypton\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow noopener noreferrer\">Krypton</a> - 优化网络堆栈。</li>\n<li><a href=\"https://modrinth.com/mod/lambdynamiclights\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow noopener noreferrer\">LambDynamicLights</a> - 添加动态光源。</li>\n<li><a href=\"https://modrinth.com/mod/language-reload\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow noopener noreferrer\">Language Reload</a> - 改进语言选择菜单。</li>\n<li><a href=\"https://modrinth.com/mod/lmd\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow noopener noreferrer\">Let Me Despawn</a> - 允许捡起物品的生物自然消失。</li>\n<li><a href=\"https://modrinth.com/mod/lithium\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow noopener noreferrer\">Lithium</a> - 添加众多游戏优化。</li>\n<li><a href=\"https://modrinth.com/mod/make_bubbles_pop\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow noopener noreferrer\">Make Bubbles Pop</a> - 让气泡粒子爆裂。</li>\n<li><a href=\"https://modrinth.com/mod/monsters-in-the-closet\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow noopener noreferrer\">Monsters in the Closet</a> - 高亮显示任何阻止你睡觉的怪物。</li>\n<li><a href=\"https://modrinth.com/mod/netherportalfix\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow noopener noreferrer\">NetherPortalFix</a> - 修复多人游戏中的下界传送门链接错误。<a href=\"https://gyazo.com/40a91e89ff83c69c3dce16fe8ca184c8\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow noopener noreferrer\"><em>授权</em></a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://modrinth.com/mod/not-enough-animations\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow noopener noreferrer\">Not Enough Animations</a> - 为原版动作添加更多动画。</li>\n<li><a href=\"https://modrinth.com/mod/particle-rain\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow noopener noreferrer\">Particle Rain</a> - 用粒子效果替换默认天气，性能优于原版雨天。</li>\n<li><a href=\"https://modrinth.com/mod/particular\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow noopener noreferrer\">Particular</a> - 通过基于粒子的视觉效果增强环境氛围。</li>\n<li><a href=\"https://modrinth.com/mod/presence-footsteps\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow noopener noreferrer\">Presence Footsteps</a> - 让脚步声听起来更好且更动态。</li>\n<li><a href=\"https://modrinth.com/mod/reeses-sodium-options\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow noopener noreferrer\">Reese's Sodium Options</a> - 改进Sodium的选项菜单。</li>\n<li><a href=\"https://modrinth.com/mod/satin-free-wakes\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow noopener noreferrer\">Satin Free Wakes</a> - 添加物体在水面移动时留下的尾迹，是<a href=\"https://modrinth.com/mod/wakes\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow noopener noreferrer\">Wakes</a>的更新版本。</li>\n<li><a href=\"https://modrinth.com/mod/shulkerboxtooltip\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow noopener noreferrer\">ShulkerBoxTooltip</a> - 允许在背包中通过“Shift”键查看潜影盒的内容。</li>\n<li><a href=\"https://modrinth.com/mod/sodium\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow noopener noreferrer\">Sodium</a> - 优化渲染。</li>\n<li><a href=\"https://modrinth.com/mod/sodium-extra\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow noopener noreferrer\">Sodium Extra</a> - 在视频设置中提供更多选项。</li>\n<li><a href=\"https://modrinth.com/mod/sodium-extras\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow noopener noreferrer\">Sodium Extras</a> - 为Sodium添加功能，以改善体验和性能。</li>\n<li><a href=\"https://modrinth.com/mod/sodiumleafculling\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow noopener noreferrer\">Sodium Leaf Culling</a> - 提升树叶渲染性能。</li>\n<li><a href=\"https://modrinth.com/mod/sodium-shadowy-path-blocks\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow noopener noreferrer\">Sodium Shadowy Path Blocks</a> - 在使用Sodium时平滑路径方块的阴影。</li>\n<li><a href=\"https://modrinth.com/mod/stendhal\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow noopener noreferrer\">Stendhal</a> - 更好的书籍写作工具。</li>\n<li><a href=\"https://modrinth.com/mod/swingthrough\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow noopener noreferrer\">SwingThrough</a> - 允许穿过障碍物（如草）攻击敌人。</li>\n<li><a href=\"https://modrinth.com/mod/tips\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow noopener noreferrer\">Tips</a> - 在加载和暂停菜单中添加提示。</li>\n<li><a href=\"https://modrinth.com/mod/tooltipfix\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow noopener noreferrer\">ToolTipFix</a> - 修复工具提示超出屏幕的问题。</li>\n<li><a href=\"https://modrinth.com/mod/visuality\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow noopener noreferrer\">Visuality</a> - 为方块和实体添加各种粒子效果。</li>\n<li><a href=\"https://modrinth.com/mod/xaeros-minimap\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow noopener noreferrer\">Xaero's Minimap</a> - 显示附近地形、玩家和实体的小地图，并支持使用路径点。</li>\n<li><a href=\"https://modrinth.com/mod/xaeros-world-map\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow noopener noreferrer\">Xaero's World Map</a> - 添加全屏世界地图。</li>\n<li><a href=\"https://modrinth.com/mod/yosbr\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow noopener noreferrer\">Your Options Shall Be Respected (YOSBR)</a> - 防止配置被更新覆盖。</li>\n<h4><strong>依赖模组：</strong></h4>\n<li><a href=\"https://modrinth.com/mod/almanac\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow noopener noreferrer\">Almanac</a> - 为Let Me Despawn所需。</li>\n<li><a href=\"https://modrinth.com/mod/balm\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow noopener noreferrer\">Balm</a> - 为Crafting Tweaks和NetherPortalFix所需。<a href=\"https://gyazo.com/40a91e89ff83c69c3dce16fe8ca184c8\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow noopener noreferrer\"><em>授权</em></a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://modrinth.com/mod/bisect-mod\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow noopener noreferrer\">BisectHosting Server Integration Menu</a> - 为我们的托管合作伙伴所需。</li>\n<li><a href=\"https://modrinth.com/mod/bookshelf-lib\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow noopener noreferrer\">Bookshelf</a> - 为Enchantment Descriptions所需。</li>\n<li><a href=\"https://modrinth.com/mod/cloth-config\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow noopener noreferrer\">Cloth Config API</a> - 许多模组所需，用于使用其游戏内配置菜单。</li>\n<li><a href=\"https://modrinth.com/mod/fabric-api\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow noopener noreferrer\">Fabric API</a> - 所有Fabric模组都需要。</li>\n<li><a href=\"https://modrinth.com/mod/iris\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow noopener noreferrer\">Iris Shaders</a> - 所有光影包都需要。</li>\n<li><a href=\"https://modrinth.com/mod/konkrete\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow noopener noreferrer\">Konkrete</a> - 为FancyMenu所需。</li>\n<li><a href=\"https://modrinth.com/mod/melody\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow noopener noreferrer\">Melody</a> - 为FancyMenu所需。</li>\n<li><a href=\"https://modrinth.com/mod/modmenu\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow noopener noreferrer\">Mod Menu</a> - 允许在游戏内配置Fabric模组。</li>\n<li><a href=\"https://modrinth.com/mod/open-loader\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow noopener noreferrer\">Open Loader</a> - 为Tips所需。</li>\n<li><a href=\"https://modrinth.com/mod/owo-lib\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow noopener noreferrer\">oωo-lib</a> - 为Particular所需。</li>\n<li><a href=\"https://modrinth.com/mod/prickle\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow noopener noreferrer\">Prickle</a> - 为Enchantment Descriptions所需。</li>\n<li><a href=\"https://modrinth.com/mod/sodium-options-api\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow noopener noreferrer\">Sodium Options API</a> - 为Sodium Leaf Culling和Sodium Extras所需。</li>\n<li><a href=\"https://modrinth.com/mod/unilib\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow noopener noreferrer\">UniLib</a> - 为CraftPresence所需。</li>\n<li><a href=\"https://modrinth.com/mod/yacl\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow noopener noreferrer\">YetAnotherConfigLib</a> - 为Satin Free Wakes所需。</li>\n<h4><strong>资源包：</strong></h4>\n<li><a href=\"https://modrinth.com/resourcepack/better-leaves\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow noopener noreferrer\">Motschen's Better Leaves</a>（<em>默认未启用</em>）- 让树叶看起来更茂密的资源包。</li>\n<h4><strong>光影包：</strong></h4>\n<li><a href=\"https://modrinth.com/shader/complementary-reimagined\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow noopener noreferrer\">Complementary Shaders - Reimagined</a>（<em>默认未启用</em>）- 推荐的光影包。</li>\n<p><center><span><em><img src=\"https://gitlab.com/cable-mc/cobblemon-assets/-/raw/master/graphics/cobblemon_divider.png?ref_type=heads\" /></em></span></center></p>\n<p><center><span><font size=\"4\"><strong><em>Cobblemon与宝可梦及Minecraft无关联。</em></font></strong></span></center></p>\n<p><center><span><font size=\"4\"><em>Minecraft是Mojang Synergies AB的商标 ｜ Pokémon是Nintendo、Creatures Inc.和GAME FREAK inc.的商标。</em></font></span></center></p>",
